    <string name="guide_button">HYPEROS SETUP GUIDE</string>
    <string name="guide_title">HyperOS setup</string>
    <string name="guide_text">1. Grant DUMP from a computer using ADB.\n2. Enable background autostart in HyperOS application settings.\n3. Allow notifications.\n4. Set battery usage to unrestricted.\n5. Start the watchdog once and verify with a sensor diagnostic app.\n6. After reboot, verify the foreground service and repeat an unlock test.</string>
